the database differs from the schema this app was compiled with:
  `notes.body` is integer in the database and text in the migrations
  `notes` has no column `created_at`
  `notes` has a column `extra` no migration makes
  `notes.seen` takes a null in the migrations and not in the database
  `notes` has no column `title`
  `notes` has no column `updated_at`
  no table `tags`
